# Everything here is regenerated by `bubblewrap update` + `bubblewrap build`
# from twa-manifest.json (see README.md) -- same principle as client/dist/
# not being committed. Only the hand-authored setup files are tracked.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!gen-manifest.js
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!twa-manifest.json
